      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one more thing—sometimes you get those employees who are just \"bad actors,\" like they're intentionally trying to undermine the team or break the rules just because they can. when dealing with that kind of disruptive personality, how does the policy change? does it move faster through the steps or do you still have to follow the same formal progression?",
